      "side": 0,
      "message": "I kind of prefer the call to VDO(), because that makes it more obvious that all the header fields are getting values. But I see that it\u0027s pretty redundant. What if just the command type field were set in the if/else if/else, and then there were a single invocation of VDO() using that variable, along with the other stuff that is common to all the command types?",
      "revId": "2898923d2f171806a92c9f17f1e8776d6df22b8f",
