      "writtenOn": "2021-02-17T07:17:51Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I do not like the VDO() macro. It was made to work for both VDM and SVDM as such isn\u0027t even that useful for what\u0027s happening here. The VDO macro encodes the SVID, structured bit, and bits 14:0 as a single field. The work this function is doing is only to form bits 14:0 and so VDO() brings nothing to the table in this instance.",
      "parentUuid": "4a4fd03c_98587ebb",
      "revId": "2898923d2f171806a92c9f17f1e8776d6df22b8f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
